    "text": "A question word makes the sentence a question on its own, so it takes no `-mY`: *Bu kim?* (Who is this?), *Sapak haçan?* (When is the lesson?), *Howa nähili?* (What's the weather like?)",
    "see": "gp-question-words"
  },
